      "text": "Spend four days at a lodge in the Amazon rainforest. Take boat trips through the flooded igapó forest, learn about Caboclo life and try fishing on the Amazon’s tributaries. Activities at the lodge are included. Optional outings include a visit with pink river dolphins, a trip to the Meeting of the Waters, a jungle hike with survival skills and a visit to the Monkey Forest."
